        "original_id": "fce37231-ab83-551b-9636-8cb50aa97e0f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kalyanji Virji Shah, Anandji Virji Shah\n- Projects: Kalyanji–Anandji\n- Awards: Filmfare Award for Best Music Director\n- Topics: discography, Bollywood music\n\nFacts:\n- Kalyanji Virji Shah was born on 30 June 1928 and died on 03 November 2000.\n- Anandji Virji Shah was born on 02 March 1933.\n- Kalyanji Virji Shah and Anandji Virji Shah were brothers from Gujarat.\n- Kalyanji Virji Shah and Anandji Virji Shah formed the Indian Bollywood composer duo Kalyanji–Anandji.\n- The Kalyanji–Anandji discography is the discography of the Bollywood composer duo Kalyanji–Anandji.\n- In 1975, Anandji Virji Shah and his brother won the Filmfare Award for Best Music Director for Kora Kagaz.",
